 ===== readme for slatec =====

SLATEC Common Mathematical Library, Version 4.1, July 1993
a comprehensive software library containing over
1400 general purpose mathematical and statistical routines
written in Fortran 77.


Source:
https://www.netlib.org/slatec/

The SLATEC Guide states:

    "The Library is in the public domain"

and further states that the SLATEC Library is intended to have no
restriction on its distribution and that routines incorporated into
the library must be in the public domain.

The original source files and their attribution/prologue comments
have been retained.
